{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o056a","title":"孙权遣海使通高句丽谋袭辽东","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o056a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"孙权遣海使通高句丽谋袭辽东","evidence":["mingdi-e-o056a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"谋袭","evidence":["mingdi-e-o056a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"初，回叙","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["mingdi-e-o056a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o056a-q","source_order":[3,399,"O056a"],"order":918}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o056a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-1bfbb4d6b2f22da8f429","layer":"original","quote":"初，权遣使浮海与高句丽通，欲袭辽东。遣幽州刺史毌丘俭率诸军及鲜卑、乌丸，〖4〗屯辽东南界；玺书征公孙渊〖5〗。渊发兵反，俭进军讨之；会连雨十日，辽水大涨〖6〗，诏俭引军还。右北平乌丸单于寇娄敦、辽西乌丸都督王护留等居辽东〖7〗，率部众随俭内附。己卯〖8〗，诏辽东将吏士民为渊所胁略不得降者，一切赦之〖9〗。辛卯〖10〗，太白昼现。渊自俭还，遂自立为燕王，置百官，称绍汉元年。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":398,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":187,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
